    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Which term of the sequence $4,\\ 20,\\ 100,\\ldots$ is equal to $12\\,500$?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "6th term",
      "worked": "$a=4$, $r=5$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=ar^{n-1}\\\\12\\,500&=4(5)^{n-1}\\\\3125&=5^{n-1}\\\\5^5&=5^{n-1}\\\\n-1&=5\\\\n&=6\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, $12\\,500$ is the 6th term.",
